#: scenario5:scenario5_DA07594C_05BB_4C6E_90E6_10C58B6D020E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 22433ab2628d37dca18cbdf3647f783fe043771d866556991b533f8126230ab1
#. default-sha256: a0e979e312fe2151d6d44741cecf78263cad05168c4152af9132ced545637b2c
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_DA07594C_05BB_4C6E_90E6_10C58B6D020E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫It would seem you are not aware whose house you’re trying to break into."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫A quanto pare non sapete a chi appartiene la casa in cui state cercando di entrare."

#: scenario5:scenario5_2571D8CD_C2FB_4FEC_9C6F_2070907546C7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4b0261efdeee59b734deffb33edd2d6770ab0ecb5498e7fd8425128dd6a229d0
#. default-sha256: 086c8283de9bd1fd7a730023c19bea2536639a3c447cb38678d2deab5c1092cf
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_2571D8CD_C2FB_4FEC_9C6F_2070907546C7"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫The world went silent, like "
"time had come to a stop.⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫No one could manage to say a word,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫Il mondo cadde nel silenzio, "
"come se il tempo si fosse fermato.⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫Nessuno riuscì a dire una parola;"

#: scenario5:scenario5_5B8B418A_299A_4647_BACA_BA4B0FA7E40C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 73a940ef984614102b6228bcde7efb8830d89292ae479f2c3e81f771da800c98
#. default-sha256: b396bdf5429a108a40f682eadab08240143429bc8bcda6fb7351c80353c5fe6c
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_5B8B418A_299A_4647_BACA_BA4B0FA7E40C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫only stare at the man who had appeared from within the mansion."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫poterono solo restare a guardare l’uomo che era appena emerso dal buio della villa."

#: scenario5:scenario5_40BE19F6_C685_4BBB_AF0E_7D7350FEEDE2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6d6d7492c723916b7fe47415ecffe2e22a26896206ccfb4cf5b6aa9816f71304
#. default-sha256: 086c7096179fb27c73f6547ba0444d0363bcecc668769135cfbfa21fdeae9ca1
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_40BE19F6_C685_4BBB_AF0E_7D7350FEEDE2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Surely you know what this place is called."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Sono certo che sapete cosa si dice a proposito di questo posto."

#: scenario5:scenario5_F9198B71_C35F_4BD1_84C0_071E80B99ABA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7fcaca7f1dba39947a0bf2d8c45f8e1de20f9dea6b141517f8862904593d9d19
